<main class="container-fluid py-4">
  <h2>My Projects</h2>

  <!-- Bootstrap grid: 1 box per row on phones, 2 on tablets, 3 on laptops -->
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
      <section class="project-box">
        <h3>Shed Construction Project</h3>
        <p>
          I worked on building a shed using different tools, materials, and measurements. This project helped
          me improve my teamwork, problem-solving, and construction skills while following safety rules.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
      <section class="project-box">
        <h3>Bench Construction Project</h3>
        <p>
          I helped build functional benches as part of a community project. I worked with others to measure
          materials, use tools, and complete the project safely and correctly.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
      <section class="project-box">
        <h3>Tech Crew Event Setup</h3>
        <p>
          I worked with lighting, sound, and digital projection equipment for school events. I also helped
          organize technical setups and made sure the equipment was ready for each event.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
      <section class="project-box">
        <h3>Cisco Packet Tracer Networking Project</h3>
        <p>
          I used Cisco Packet Tracer to build and configure different network topologies using routers,
          switches, and end devices. I practiced IP addressing, connectivity testing, and troubleshooting.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
      <section class="project-box">
        <h3>AI Cybersecurity Agents Project</h3>
        <p>
          I am working on an AI cybersecurity project where different agents are assigned their own security
          tasks. The agents are designed to scan networks, detect possible security problems, and send issues
          to the correct agent for further analysis and troubleshooting.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

